Open pipeline.py. Keep the world and protocol filters. Select the current fly for personal memory. Exclude the current fly for shared memory.

def scope(world, protocol, fly, shared=False):
    """Use compatible observations from the current memory scope."""
    must = [
        FieldCondition("world", match=MatchValue(world)),
        FieldCondition("protocol", match=MatchValue(protocol)),
    ]
    source = FieldCondition("source_fly", match=MatchValue(fly))
    if shared:
        return Filter(must=must, must_not=[source])
    return Filter(must=[*must, source])

Run uv run run.py --check shared. Save and select Shared memory. Query.Nearest, the vector, score threshold, and decision function stay the same. The source rule changes. Source: https://qdrant.tech/documentation/edge/edge-api/reading-data/ .
